{"id": "Deg79cYisCK", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Without Einstein, your phone's GPS would be off by about 10 km. Every single day. 🛰️\n\nGPS satellites keep broadcasting the exact time, and your phone works out where you are from tiny delays. But up there time runs differently: speed slows the clocks, weaker gravity speeds them up. Net: +38 microseconds a day, which grows into ~10 km of error.\n\nSo engineers set the satellite clocks slightly slow before launch. Send this to your physics friend 🤓\n\n#gps #einstein #relativity #techexplained #howtechworks", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792069206, "like_count": 22, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140367889575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.188, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOOgDmlO7lFoEIK_bPbDaVxKcCVgy3hJlrxso9LaWkLpxYza6uW0eA0GWVmAfx0pIYbVX3fbqjelKjFTb5AEPnPhnjo_4vGaoPlwrY.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdpAI5vj04EAml6lacDLALDKPNW4kjWpSV70DNh0VjzNpPq90B7BunVFQZwbpr3zUdPJc7LiOsyNZd0r0Ac-zBDx&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=QBvfeBMOR-8Q7kNvwELFSu-&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=66inkVo6zCLVxSXPdcnxqw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQQ2X6Q0n_g93JZ77tu1eDyjlGc6qkqZ9tQ5Fg9H0sp7g&oe=6AF43612", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.188, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "http